Approval Framework
- Required CEO human review creates a pending approval assigned to an active Owner/Super Admin and writes in-app notifications for governance approvers.
- Approval Center supports reasoned approve, reject, and request-information decisions; decision API enforces assigned approver or Owner/Super Admin and audits the action.
- Final approval sets the requirement Approved and idempotently creates one Planned project plus seven Planned tasks in the same transaction.
- Rejection and information request block project creation. In-app notification inbox is scoped per user.
- Authenticated Approval Center exposes pending items, requires a reason, and refreshes decision state after completion.
- SQL Server migration `sql/06_approval_notifications.sql` is applied locally; it adds notification storage and an approval decision timestamp.
- Still outstanding: configurable multi-stage approvals, SLA/escalation, external email/mobile delivery, approval record versioning, voice approval, and full workflow execution/recovery engine.
- Voice assistant and voice approvals are future roadmap items; voice alone must never authorize critical decisions.

Delivery Governance Dependencies
- Notifications are in-app only; external email/mobile delivery and SLA escalation remain unimplemented.
- Approval workflow is a single-stage MVP; configurable stages, approval version concurrency, and recovery orchestration remain future work.
- Planned task creation does not execute work, provision accounts, message employees, or deploy software.
- Voice intake and voice approvals are not implemented; require MFA, explicit read-back confirmation, anti-replay controls, and auditable consent before any approval use.

